      "answer": "The approved live patch window for Verdant Bay is 2026-03-24 from 02:00 to 04:00 local time. The rollback procedure if validation checks fail is to use the command 'orchestrator rollback --target ruleset=<prior_sha>' which rehydrates the prior ruleset and replays the cache invalidation hook. After rollback, Verdant Bay is notified, an incident is opened for manual remediation, and any partial replays are reverted. This rollback is automatic if any validation job (which includes synthetic and in-flight approval flows) fails during the patch process [art_fff67d92fe41].",
