      "answer": "The customer most likely to defect to a cheaper tactical competitor if the next promised milestone is missed is Pioneer Freight Solutions. The exact milestone at risk is the acceptance of the remediation plan for the taxonomy change incident, specifically the verification of schema registry compatibility and collection of the taxonomy snapshot due by 2026-03-22, followed by the build of a shadow index (2026-03-29 to 2026-04-09), backfill and recomputation of index weights (2026-04-12 to 2026-04-30), and validation window (2026-05-01 to 2026-05-14). Failure to meet these milestones risks the customer extending a tactical PoC with NoiseGuard, a cheaper competitor, and reducing scope with Northstar, posing a high retention risk [art_7373b64fdfdd, art_ac8afb52f2d3].",
